OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GVocalist and multidisciplinary
OL,12,     Gartist Zola Marcelle is sitting
OL,13,     Gin for Soweto this week on 'Round
OL,14,     GMidnight.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GIn this birthday concert, chamber
OL,17,     Gmusic classics by Beethoven and
OL,18,     GBrahms are performed alongside a
OL,19,     Gnew work by the Swiss oboist,
OL,20,     Gcomposer and conductor Heinz
OL,21,     GHolliger.
